<Base slug="borrowed/" title="What we take from others" description="What The Cousin borrows from TikTok, Instagram Reels, Spotify, Google Maps and District, and what it does differently.">
  <header class="wrap phead">
    <p class="chapter">07 · Borrowed ideas</p>
    <h1 class="h1" data-split="lines" data-intro>Good ideas from great apps, bent for going out.</h1>
    <div class="headrow" data-reveal="up" data-intro data-delay="0.3">
      <p class="lede muted">We don’t need to invent every mechanism. The best apps already solved parts of this problem. We take the part that fits and leave the part that keeps people on the screen.</p>
      <p class="muted">The Reels, TikTok, Google and District rows come from the blueprint research. The Spotify rows are new proposals for discussion.</p>
      <Status s="open" />
    </div>
  </header>
  <section class="wrap row">
    <p class="chapter">The list</p>
    <div class="tbl" tabindex="0"><table><thead><tr><th>From</th><th>What they do</th><th>What we take</th><th>What we change</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>TikTok</td><td>Learns taste from what you watch, fast</td><td>Learning from every outcome, not just what you say</td><td>Outcomes are real evenings, not seconds watched</td></tr><tr><td>Instagram Reels</td><td>Mixes known creators with new ones</td><td>Safe, stretch and wild in every list</td><td>Three ideas, not an endless feed</td></tr><tr><td>Spotify</td><td>Discover Weekly, a fresh personal mix each week</td><td>A Thursday nudge with ideas made for you</td><td>Ideas you go out and do</td></tr><tr><td>Spotify Wrapped</td><td>A yearly story of your taste</td><td>A recap of places, people and parts of town</td><td>Shared with friends who were there</td></tr><tr><td>Google Maps</td><td>Places, hours, routes</td><td>Live facts and travel times</td><td>We plan the whole evening, not one search</td></tr><tr><td>District / Zomato</td><td>Events, tickets, tables</td><td>Events and bookings as one piece of a plan</td><td>We fit them into your evening and your rules</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
  </section>
</Base>
